{
  "dialogue": [
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:21:28",
      "utterance": "おはようございます。本日、カウンセラー役をさせていただきます。",
      "tag": "Greeting"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:21:37",
      "utterance": "お時間になりましたら、どうぞよろしくおねがい致します。",
      "tag": "Greeting"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:25:35",
      "utterance": "おはよう御座います。本日はよろしくお願いいたします。",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:30:26",
      "utterance": "それでは、始めさせていただきます。どうぞよろしくおねがい致します。",
      "tag": "Greeting"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:30:40",
      "utterance": "おはようございます。相談員です。",
      "tag": "Greeting"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:30:46",
      "utterance": "本日はどうされましたか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:31:16",
      "utterance": "よろしくお願いいたします。",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:32:17",
      "utterance": "友人が仕事で疲れている様子で",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:32:29",
      "utterance": "なんとかしてあげたいです",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:32:41",
      "utterance": "そうなのですね。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:32:48",
      "utterance": "それは、心配になりますね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:32:53",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:33:19",
      "utterance": "上司との人間関係が特に悩んでる様子です",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:33:49",
      "utterance": "そうなのですね。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:33:55",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:35:02",
      "utterance": "上司との人間関係は、大変ですよね。お友達を思う心配されるお気持ち、伝わってきます。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:35:44",
      "utterance": "はい、大変そうです。",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:37:10",
      "utterance": "お友達は、どのようなお友達なのか、お伺いしてもよろしいでしょうか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:38:10",
      "utterance": "中学時代のクラスメートで同じバレーボール部に所属してました",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:38:44",
      "utterance": "そうなのですね。それ以来ずっと仲が良いお友達なのですか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:39:00",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:40:18",
      "utterance": "そうなのですね。長い付き合いのお友達が、仕事で悩まれていたら、やはり心配になってしまいますよね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:40:49",
      "utterance": "はい。そう思います。",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:41:25",
      "utterance": "お友達は、上司との関係について、どのようにおっしゃっていますか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:43:15",
      "utterance": "事あるごとにガミガミ言い、仕事がしづらく、",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:43:24",
      "utterance": "はい。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:43:29",
      "utterance": "関わるとストレスを感じるそうです。",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:43:47",
      "utterance": "なるほど、そうなのですね。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:43:55",
      "utterance": "それは大変そうですね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:43:55",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:44:07",
      "utterance": "大変そうです",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:44:59",
      "utterance": "それを聞いた時、どのようなお気持ちでしたか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:45:41",
      "utterance": "なんとかしたいと思いました",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:46:15",
      "utterance": "ただ自分に何ができるかわからないという感じです",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:46:30",
      "utterance": "そうなのですね。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:46:36",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:46:39",
      "utterance": "先ほども書きましたが、",
      "tag": "Affirmation"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:46:59",
      "utterance": "友達を思われている気持ちがとても伝わってきます。お優しいのですね。",
      "tag": "Affirmation"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:47:18",
      "utterance": "ありがとうございます",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:47:39",
      "utterance": "中学の頃からのお付き合いとのことでしたが、",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:48:03",
      "utterance": "以前にも同じような気持ちになったことはありましたか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:49:09",
      "utterance": "以前も少し悩んでるようでしたが、",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:49:16",
      "utterance": "はい。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:49:32",
      "utterance": "今はもっと悩んでるようすです",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:49:48",
      "utterance": "そうなのですね。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:49:59",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:51:17",
      "utterance": "お友達が相談されてきた時のご様子はどのような感じでしたか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:51:50",
      "utterance": "体調などについておっしゃっていたりはしたでしょうか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:52:18",
      "utterance": "普段より表情が暗かったです",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:52:33",
      "utterance": "そうなのですね。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:53:16",
      "utterance": "相談されたというより、仕事のことかな？と察知しました",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:53:57",
      "utterance": "そうなのですね。直接言われた訳ではなかったのですね。",
      "tag": "Paraphrase"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:54:57",
      "utterance": "どちらかというとそうなります。",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:55:19",
      "utterance": "そうなのですね。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:55:25",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:57:02",
      "utterance": "以前の話に戻ってしまうのですが、",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:57:38",
      "utterance": "以前お友達が少し悩まれていた時も、何かしてあげたいな、という風にお思いになりましたか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:58:24",
      "utterance": "思いました。",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T10:59:09",
      "utterance": "その時は、どのようにお友達にして差し上げましたか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:00:03",
      "utterance": "そうですね…",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:01:14",
      "utterance": "相談できる先輩に、上司との上手い関わり方を聞いてみるのは？",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:01:29",
      "utterance": "と言いました",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:02:04",
      "utterance": "そうだったのですね。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:02:11",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:02:15",
      "utterance": "お友達はどのような反応でしたか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:03:26",
      "utterance": "「そうするよ」と言ってました",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:04:06",
      "utterance": "私は「なにかあればいつでも相談して」とも言いました",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:04:46",
      "utterance": "そうだったのですね。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:04:50",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:06:39",
      "utterance": "なにかあればいつでも相談して、という言葉に対して、お友達はどのような反応でしたか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:06:53",
      "utterance": "「ありがとう」と言ってました",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:07:49",
      "utterance": "そうだったのですね。その時どのようなお気持ちでしたか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:09:42",
      "utterance": "まずは見守ろうと思いました。",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:10:08",
      "utterance": "様子を見てまたできることをしようと思いました",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:11:02",
      "utterance": "そうだったのですね。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:11:28",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:13:33",
      "utterance": "見守られて、お友達のその後ご様子はいかがでしたか？話が少し飛んでしまうかもしれませんが、その後、現在の大変そうに見える状況、という事で大丈夫でしょうか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:13:49",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:13:54",
      "utterance": "仰せの通りです",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:14:14",
      "utterance": "なるほど、そうなのですね。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:14:36",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:15:25",
      "utterance": "見守っているお友達が、辛そうに見えるのは、ご自身にとっても辛いお気持ちになりますよね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:15:46",
      "utterance": "そうですね…",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:16:58",
      "utterance": "今回、お友達に実際にして差し上げたことは何かありましたか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:18:50",
      "utterance": "仕事は続ける予定？と聞いたら",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:18:59",
      "utterance": "はい。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:18:59",
      "utterance": "続けると言ってました",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:19:20",
      "utterance": "そうなのですね。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:19:32",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:20:14",
      "utterance": "同じ質問をしてしまって恐縮なのですが、その時にどのようにお感じになりましたか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:21:56",
      "utterance": "そうですね…",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:22:38",
      "utterance": "その意思を尊重しようと思いました",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:22:54",
      "utterance": "そうなのですね。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:23:19",
      "utterance": "あとは趣味を聞いたり、平日に何かできそうなことも聞きました",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:23:44",
      "utterance": "そうだったのですね。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:23:47",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:24:01",
      "utterance": "その時のお友達はどのような様子でしたか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:25:35",
      "utterance": "詳しく覚えてないですが、気を紛らすことは少しはできた気がします",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:26:38",
      "utterance": "そうだったのですね。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:26:59",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:27:37",
      "utterance": "今日お話を伺っていて、とてもお友達のことを心配されて、思われているのがとても伝わってきました。",
      "tag": "Affirmation"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:28:14",
      "utterance": "そして、お友達に何かしてあげられることはないか、とても考えておられる。",
      "tag": "Affirmation"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:28:40",
      "utterance": "しかも、ご自身の意見をアドバイス的に言うのではなくて、",
      "tag": "Affirmation"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:28:59",
      "utterance": "見守られたり、尊重したり、",
      "tag": "Affirmation"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:29:45",
      "utterance": "質問をしたりして、",
      "tag": "Affirmation"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-04-03T11:30:12",
      "utterance": "本当の意味でのお気遣いをされている、そんな印象を受けました。",
